./_bmad-output/implementation-artifacts/2026-08-28-G8-6-dogfood协议-v2.md:172:| C1 | 每日生成自检 | `$DATA_ROOT/backups/daily-review.log`（行式 `[D HH:MM:SS] vault=<key> generate:… push:… fallback:…`；`daily_review_run.py:31,38,95-100`） | `python3 -c "import sys;L=[l for l in open('$DATA_ROOT/backups/daily-review.log',encoding='utf-8') if l.startswith('[$D') and ' vault=$VAULT_KEY ' in l and 'generate:' in l];sys.exit(0 if L and 'FAILED' not in L[-1] else 1)"`（当日最后一条 generate 非 FAILED；无行 = FAIL） | 可用 |
./_bmad-output/implementation-artifacts/2026-08-28-G8-6-dogfood协议-v2.md:180:| C9 | degraded 信号枚举 | **实际 log 取值**（`daily_review_run.py:211,216-249`）：`generate:FAILED`；`push:failed`（Bark 发送失败）；`push:skip-nokey`（Bark key 未配置）；`fallback:ok`（走了本地 osascript 兜底 = Bark 链已降级）；`fallback:fail`（连兜底都失败）。正常值：`push:accepted`/`skip-empty`/`skip-done`/`skip-window`、`fallback:-`。另加：总览页 stale/no_projection/corrupt；C2/C3 判定 FAIL 且无 skip 解释 | `python3 -c "import sys;S=(' generate:FAILED',' push:failed',' push:skip-nokey',' fallback:ok',' fallback:fail');L=[l for l in open('$DATA_ROOT/backups/daily-review.log',encoding='utf-8') if l.startswith('[$D') and ' vault=$VAULT_KEY ' in l and any(s in l for s in S)];print(''.join(L));sys.exit(1 if L else 0)"`（exit 1 = 有 degraded 信号 → 登记事件行）+ 总览页人工目检 | 可用（页面态靠目检，历史快照机制属残余） |
